    {
      "text": "RESURGENCE, HABIRO ELEMENTS AND STRANGE IDENTITIES — We prove resurgence properties for the Borel transform of a formal power series associated to elements in the Habiro ring that come from radial\n\n**RESURGENCE, HABIRO ELEMENTS AND STRANGE IDENTITIES**\n\n*SAMUEL CREW, VERONICA FANTINI, ANKUSH GOSWAMI, ROBERT OSBURN*\n\n20 pp, 7 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We prove resurgence properties for the Borel transform of a formal power series associated to elements in the Habiro ring that come from radial limits of partial theta series via strange identities. As an application, we prove a conjecture in quantum topology due to Costin and Garoufalidis for two families of torus knots.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Proof of Theorem 1.2; 3 Proof of Theorem 1.4 and Corollary 1.5; 4 Concluding Remarks; Acknowledgements; References",
